Created to bring the Moneris code closer to PSR-4 standards. At the very least, to remove the many warnings during code checks when including Moneris Libraries.

## Release Notes

###### v1.0.6 - 2026-10-16
* Fix - MpgResponse, MpiResponse, RiskResponse: Replaced deprecated xml_set_object() and string handler names with method callables (PHP 8.4 deprecations).
* Fix - MpgRequest: Added missing incremental_preauth transaction type, which threw a TypeError.
* Update - MpgRequest: Added is_incremental to preauth, cavv_preauth, res_preauth_cc and res_cavv_preauth_cc. Ported from Moneris master.

###### v1.0.5 - 2025-10-14
* Update - Master updated, imported to this repo.

###### v1.0.4 - 2025-10-07
* Fix - Error on MpgHttpsPost: $xmlString using ?string was not enough.

###### v1.0.3 - 2025-10-07
* Fix - Error on MpgHttpsPost: $xmlString must not be accessed before initialization

###### v1.0.2 - 2025-10-07
* Fix - Error on MpgRequest: $xmlString must not be accessed before initialization
* Update - Moved toXML_low to reusable trait.
* Update - Added Readme

###### v1.0.1 - 2025-10-06
* Update - Added ext-curl to the required extensions in composer.json.

###### v1.0.0 - 2025-10-06
* New - Extracted each class from the mpgClasses.php file and gave them their own file.
* Update - Updated the code to closer adhere to PSR-4 standards.
* Update - Added return types to many methods but not all.
